- **Clean fixture:** passes and publishes 12 runs and 8 summary rows. My separate recomputation agrees to 3.6e-15. That calculation was: mean of brain-masked values over the 219 cases for each target, then an equal-weight mean over the 4 targets. Seed means and sample SDs (n−1 = 2) also match.
