- **The GPU sentence in `B1_REPEATS.md` is fixed text.** The code never checks it against the recorded GPUs. In my test I swapped the GPUs of two seed45 runs, and the report still published the "A6000 vs Ada" sentence, which was then false. It is true for all 12 runs as recorded now. It could go stale only if `uniform-s05-seed45` were requeued onto a different GPU.
